 Prices are integer cents everywhere. Run the tests with `npm test`.
+
+## Discount codes
+
+`orders.applyCode(orderNumber, code)` lets an order take one code (a second replaces the first):
+`SPRING10` takes 10 % off the items (rounded to the cent, half a cent up); `WELCOME5` takes 5.00 € off items
+of 30.00 € or more. Unknown codes, and `WELCOME5` on a smaller order, are refused and the order is left as it was.
+`totals` shows the `discountCents` (0 without a code); `totalCents` is items minus discount plus shipping.
+Shipping is never discounted, and free shipping (items of 50.00 € or more) is decided before any discount.
