+# Discount codes for the spring campaign
+
+An order may take one discount code, via `applyCode(orderNumber, code)` on the order book.
+
+- `SPRING10`: 10 % off the order's items, rounded to the nearest cent, half a cent up.
+- `WELCOME5`: 5.00 € off the items, only when the items come to 30.00 € or more.
+- One code per order at most; a second replaces the first.
+- Unknown code, or `WELCOME5` on a smaller order: refused with an error saying why; order unchanged.
+- Shipping is never discounted; free shipping is decided on the items before any discount.
+- Totals gain `discountCents` (0 without a code); `totalCents` = items - discount + shipping.
